  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Building Better Brains (A13076)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Building Better Brains is aimed to ensure all young children in the Pacific have their rights to survival, protection, development and participation&#xa0; realised.&#xa0;A regional approach will deliver on a collective agenda for&#xa0;Early Childhood Development (ECD) in the Pacific. At national level, it will improve an enabling environment for ECD in&#xa0;8 Pacific countries - Kiribati, Solomon Islands, RMI, Vanuatu, Fiji, FSM, Samoa Tuvalu and Tokelau. It will&#xa0;also develop a parenting program at community level.</narrative>
  </description>
